#: main.cpp:17
msgid ""
"KLettres helps a very young child or an adult learning \n"
"a new language by associating sounds and \n"
"letters in this language.\n"
"6 languages are available: Czech, Danish, Dutch, French, Italian and Slovak."
msgstr ""
"KLettres axuda ós cativos e ós adultos a aprender \n"
"unha nova lingua por asociación de sons e \n"
"letras nesa lingua\n"
"Seis idiomas están dispoñibles: checo, danés, holandés, "
"francés, italiano e eslovaco."

